### Test Lesson Image Questions API (Question Bank Lessons)

### 1. Add text questions to question bank lesson
POST http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lessons/40/questions/text
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bulk_text": "السؤال الأول؟\nA) الخيار الأول\nB) الخيار الثاني\nC) الخيار الثالث\nD) الخيار الرابع\n\nالسؤال الثاني؟\nA) الخيار الأول\nB) الخيار الثاني\nC) الخيار الثالث\nD) الخيار الرابع"
}

### 2. Add image questions to question bank lesson
POST http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lessons/40/questions/images
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Upload multiple images (up to 10)
# In a real request, you would attach image files like this:
# images: [file1.jpg, file2.jpg, file3.jpg]
# Note: This works with lessons in the question bank (lessons table), not course lectures
# Fixed: updated_at column issue resolved
# Fixed: SQL parameter count mismatch resolved
# Fixed: 503 error - compatibility with both old and new database schemas
# Updated: Now returns ALL questions (text and image) from both old and new tables
# Enhanced: Added comprehensive search across all question sources
# Now searches: questions (new), lesson_questions, exam_questions, and direct image questions
# Fixed: Image questions now properly added to lesson and retrieved correctly
# Added: Comprehensive debugging logs to track question retrieval
# Fixed: Answer selection now works for both old and new question formats
# Enhanced: Added specific queries for image questions with lesson_id
# Fixed: Added priority queries for image questions at the beginning
# Fixed: Removed general questions queries that were showing unrelated questions
# Fixed: Removed duplicate queries that were causing image questions to appear 3 times

### 2. Get questions from question bank lesson (new format)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lessons/40/questions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Get question choices (for answer selection)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/201/choices
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Set correct answer for question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/questions/201/answer
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correctChoiceId": 0
}

### 5. Update question
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/questions/201
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "السؤال المحدث؟",
  "options": ["الخيار الأول", "الخيار الثاني", "الخيار الثالث", "الخيار الرابع"],
  "correct_answer": "الخيار الأول"
}

### 6. Delete question
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/questions/201
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

# This endpoint now works with question bank lessons (lessons table)
# Structure: Question Bank → Subject → Chapter → Lesson

### 3. Get questions from lesson (old format for comparison)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lecture/39/questions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Set correct answer for a question
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lecture-question/36/answer
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correct_answer": 1
}

### 5. Update a question
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lecture-question/36
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Optional: question_text: "Updated question text"
# Optional: grade: 2
# Optional: image: [new_image_file]

### 6. Delete a question
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/lesson-questions/lecture-question/36
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
